# CIS Compliance Implementation Plan — SentinelStream (Branch: CIS)

## What This Does
Aligns the existing SentinelStream microservices with four selected CIS Controls by adding real intelligence to the system — asset auto-discovery, enriched risk scoring, deeper audit/alert persistence, and anomaly detection. No API-Gateway, Auth-Service, or Service-Registry changes are touched.

---

## Services In Scope

| Service | Focus |
|---|---|
| `asset-service` | CIS Control 1 — Asset Inventory |
| `Event-Ingestion-Service` | CIS Control 3 — Event Pipeline hardening |
| `RISK-ENGINE` | CIS Control 7 & 13 — Risk + Anomaly |
| `ALERT-SERVICE` | CIS Control 8 & 17 — Audit log depth |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> We are **NOT** changing API-Gateway, Auth-Service, or Service-Registry.

