## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q1**: The `asset-discovery-engine` is described as a **new standalone service** in the plan. Do you want it as a new service, or as a Kafka consumer added directly inside `asset-service`? (I've proposed inside `asset-service` to keep it simple for now.)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q2**: The `assetId` type is `Long` in EIS and `UUID` in asset-service/risk-engine. This is an existing mismatch. Do you want me to fix this inconsistency or leave it as-is?

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q3**: Should the Kafka consumer in `asset-service` for auto-discovery listen to the same `asset-events` topic that EIS already pushes to, or a different topic?
